// Title: Suspicious Debugger Registration Cmdline
// ID: ae215552-081e-44c7-805f-be16f975c8a2
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), oscd.community, Jonhnathan Ribeiro
// Date: 2019-09-06
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1546.008
// Description: Detects the registration of a debugger for a program that is available in the logon screen (sticky key backdoor).
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.command_line like "*_\\CurrentVersion\\Image File Execution Options\\*") and ((process.command_line like "*_sethc.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_utilman.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_osk.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_magnify.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_narrator.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_displayswitch.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_atbroker.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_HelpPane.exe*")))
